   "The packets are called quanta. Curled up in two places is called a wave or superposition. Peeking is called measurement. Quantum mechanics is just the rulebook for things that small.",
   "Hold two pairs of polarizing sunglasses at right angles and see black. Now picture a third pair at 45 degrees in the middle: light returns. The lab in this chapter lets you do it with virtual filters.",
